# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.
#
# xrpl.to API key — lifts the anonymous limit of 333 requests/day to ~33,000, raises the burst
# from 2/sec to 20/sec, and is REQUIRED for token thumbnails (they answer 401 without it).
# Obtain one with: node _tools/apikey-server.js   (signs with GemWallet)
XRPLTO_API_KEY=
